mutual friend introduced Mrs. Ford to Jerry in 1947. A successful lawyer and former star of the University of Michigan's football team, the future president was not quite in public life when they met.

[[00:00:39.940]]
UNIDENTIFIED SPEAKER
No one

[[00:00:40.400]]
